<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Normal People Things</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lovejoy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Normal People Things</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1vJmd8YIIAz6XQ9GHlUr5p</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.993" end="00:19.347">Panic attack, backing track</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.347" end="00:23.571">A background hum for cerebellum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.571" end="00:25.071" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.809" end="00:30.269">Oh, what a blessing to meet someone like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.269" end="00:32.942">With eyes as dead as mine, it's fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.942" end="00:34.442">It's normal people things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.965" end="00:39.020">Just to lie here in silence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.020" end="00:40.689" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.689" end="00:45.941">Spending days in, self-medicating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.941" end="00:48.546">There's too much weight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.546" end="00:51.600">Unpleasant aftertaste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.600" end="00:56.426">We think the same, play different games</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.426" end="00:59.439">Since I like to refuse, hope you blink before I do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.439" end="01:04.233">Then pray and pray that you'll go and do it anyway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.233" end="01:06.482" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.482" end="01:14.482">Hold your breath, I'll make it worth the wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.926" end="01:23.282">Hold your breath to your chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.282" end="01:26.204">And come back and see me, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.204" end="01:34.204" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.344" end="01:38.844">You rub the makeup off my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.591" end="01:40.425">That I was using to hide the stubble rash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.425" end="01:42.061">I gave myself while shaving</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.061" end="01:44.734">Yes, it's probably a razor thing but honestly, it's harmless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.734" end="01:46.466">And I refuse to let the sensitive skin win</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.466" end="01:47.966" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.950" end="01:52.716">Oh, what a blessing to meet someone like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.716" end="01:55.622">With eyes as dead as mine, it's fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.622" end="01:57.122">It's normal people things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.656" end="02:00.452">Just to lie here in silence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.452" end="02:01.952" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.800" end="02:03.569">So, we lie here in silence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.569" end="02:06.048">Yes, we lie here in silence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.048" end="02:07.548">This is normal people things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.444" end="02:09.081">Just to lie here in silence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.081" end="02:10.581" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.399" end="02:18.399">Hold your breath, I'll make it worth the wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.046" end="02:27.442">Hold your breath to your chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.442" end="02:31.628">And come back and see me, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.628" end="02:38.212">Hold your breath to your chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.212" end="02:42.212">And come back and see me, yeah</p></div></body></tt>